  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring, Evidence, Research and Learning (MERL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A dedicated MERL component will provide the evidence gathering and learning to help improve the programming for both Technical Assistance and financial aid components. This will strengthen the evidence base and improve the delivery of climate programming in FCDO and across government in Rwanda and play a pro-active role in overseeing progress on projects mobilised with FCDO co-financing.</narrative>
  </description>
